        "short_description": "TerraClear Inc is an agricultural technology company founded in 2017, focused on AI-driven rock management and robotic rock removal solutions. The company aims to enhance productivity for large-scale agriculture, particularly in broad-acre row crops. By integrating advanced technologies such as aerial sensing, machine vision, high-accuracy GPS, and robotics, TerraClear provides solutions that help farmers control costs and concentrate on more valuable production tasks.\n\nBased in Bellevue, Washington, and Grangeville, Idaho, TerraClear has developed a range of products and services. These include the TC Rock Picker, a robotic arm for autonomous rock clearing, and the Rock Map, a drone-derived tool for visualizing rock locations. The company also offers a rock picking service and is set to launch TerraScout, a fully autonomous robot for image collection and weed identification. TerraClear targets large-scale growers in the Pacific Northwest and across the United States, addressing the challenges of rock accumulation in farming.",
