        "short_description": "CERT Systems is a climate technology company dedicated to decarbonization by converting carbon dioxide emissions into sustainable high-value chemicals. The company specializes in producing sustainable ethylene through a unique single-step process known as CO\u2082 electrolysis. This innovative approach utilizes only water and electricity, making it a cost-effective solution that minimizes capital expenditure and physical footprint compared to traditional methods.\n\nRecognized for its groundbreaking work, CERT Systems was a finalist in the NRG COSIA Carbon XPRIZE and has received support from the Breakthrough Energy Fellows program, founded by Bill Gates. The company aims to mitigate over half a gigatonne of annual CO\u2082 emissions, with each tonne of ethylene produced sequestering over three tonnes of CO\u2082. CERT Systems targets industries involved in industrial emissions and chemical production, providing a sustainable option for businesses looking to reduce their carbon footprint while producing valuable chemicals.",
